fix: Close building polygons, custom markers, and update package versions

Map fixes:
- Fix buildings showing incomplete by repeating first point to close polygon
- Replace plain pinColor markers with custom label markers (colored pill + name)
- StudentHome: category-colored markers with name labels, stop markers with green dot
- PathfinderScreen: origin/dest show "From"/"To" with white border highlight
- Add tracksViewChanges=false for better marker rendering performance

Package updates:
- expo 54.0.36 -> ~54.0.37
- expo-local-authentication 17.0.8 -> ~17.0.9
